{"items":[{"item":{"id":"customer-references#marketreader-nasdaq-2025","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"marketreader-nasdaq-2025","dateCreated":"2025-02-14T21:42:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2025-03-07T01:09:40+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eMarketReader is an artificial intelligence (AI) analytics platform providing the financial sector with data-driven explanations of real-time asset movement. During development, MarketReader experienced delays in data delivery and received incomplete datasets from its initial data provider\u0026mdash;which reduced the quality of the platform\u0026rsquo;s insights. To launch its differentiated product, the MarketReader team moved to cloud-based data solutions from AWS Partner Nasdaq, hosted on Amazon Web Services (AWS), to obtain direct access to high-quality, real-time market data for all US-listed securities. This approach elevated MarketReader\u0026rsquo;s US market coverage, increased data delivery time by 98 percent, and helped the platform go live within eight months. MarketReader now delivers timely, accurate insights. It publishes a daily newsletter in only seven minutes, driving customer engagement and expanding the newsletter\u0026rsquo;s reach up to 400 percent beyond MarketReader\u0026rsquo;s current client base.\u003c/p\u003e\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Market%20Reader%20Logo%20200x70px.9bf994faf0e797e9a6d55b3eec35cee43329793d.png","displayLocation":"United States","footerInfoText":"2025","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2025-02-14","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/marketreader-nasdaq/","customer-name":"MarketReader","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2025","contentType":"Case Study","headline":"MarketReader Launches Its Real-Time Market Analysis Platform and AI Newsletter in Eight Months Using Nasdaq® and AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#s3","locale":"