ace, providing engineers with a software-as-a-service (SaaS) platform that analyzes, troubleshoots, and optimizes their entire software stack. In 2020, New Relic went on a journey to transform its business, moving from a host-based to a consumption-based pricing model. In addition, New Relic introduced a free service tier to all customers and prepared for a significant increase in demand on its platform.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/new-relic-logo%401x.3104541e903ed9ae838ad315973a4cb9b82eac98.png","displayLocation":"United States","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2021-05-21","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/new-relic-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2021","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"New Relic Shifts Business Mode, Manages Unprecedented Growth with Amazon EKS","customer-name":"New Relic"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#containers","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Containers","description":"Containers","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:32+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:37+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#namer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"North America","description":"North America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#containers","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name"