ceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#lopes","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"lopes","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:08:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-06-08T04:07:42+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Com mais de 80 anos de atuação no mercado brasileiro, a Lopes é hoje a maior empresa de soluções de integradas de intermediação, consultoria e promoção de financiamentos de imóveis do Brasil. Em 2019, atendendo ao objetivo de se tornar uma tech company, a Lopes iniciou sua jornada de digitalização  pela reformulação de seu portal e agora incorpora novidades como o desenvolvimento do Lopes Avalia, algoritmo de precificação de imóveis, ambos baseados na infraestrutura e em serviços oferecidos pela AWS, alcançando um crescimento de mais de 1000% nos leads gerados e de quase 850% no volume de sessões orgânicas.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/lopes-logo%402x.23ce1372e5eff7b68c035845f2132113116416e3.png","displayLocation":"Brasil","footerInfoText":"Data de publicação","industry":"Imóveis e construção","sortDate":"2021-01-01","enableShare":"1","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/pt/solutions/case-studies/lopes/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","publishedDate":"2021","contentType":"História do cliente","customer-name":"Lopes (LPS)","headline":"Com infraestrutura AWS, nova plataforma digital da Lopes tem 1000% mais leads gerados"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#business-apps","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Business Applications","description":"Business Applications","dateCreated":"2020-08-20T04:22:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#app-integration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Application Integration","description":"Application Integration","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#portuguese","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Portuguese","description":"Portuguese","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#latam","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Latin America","description":"Latin America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:06+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#construction-real-estate","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Construction \u0026 Real Estate","description":"Construction \u002